{"u": "10769969724", "name": "Shibuya [Beta]", "place": "92832059482592", "created": "2026-10-09", "updated": "2026-11-25T18:00:14.553Z", "genre": "RPG", "subgenre": "Action RPG", "desc": "NEXT CODE AT 20000 LIKES!\n\nShibuya is a Jujutsu Kaisen inspired fighting game set 1000 years after the original story. Climb the sorcerer grades, earn cursed techniques through hard trials, contain curses instead of exorcising them, and fight in virtual Tube Simulations. The game has hardcore elements, and the stronger you get, the more a careless death can cost you.\n\nL to equip your weapon\nTab to view the leaderboard\nBackspace to drop an item\nJ to devour a contained curse\nM1 to attack\nM2 or R for a critical attack\nQ to dash, hold Q to lunge\nF to block, tap F right before a hit to parry\nE to infuse your attacks with cursed energy\nX to uppercut, X again to rushdown\nB to grip NPCs or players\nV to carry NPCs, players or objects\nP to summon your vehicle\n\n\nThe game is currently in its early stages and things are subject to change/improvement.\nNOTE: This experience contains visual effects that may trigger epilepsy.", "desc_hash": "c0fe14a12da6", "max_players": 25, "vip": false, "price": null, "avatar": "MorphToR15", "visits": 7610986, "favorites": 27515, "creator": {"id": 349591233, "name": "Project Mᅠ", "type": "Group", "verified": false}, "daily": {"2026-11-05": {"updated": "2026-11-05T17:13:47.26Z", "visits": 806932, "fav": 4656, "up": 3124, "down": 446}, "2026-11-06": {"updated": "2026-11-06T17:49:06.46Z", "visits": 1067588, "fav": 6704, "up": 4263, "down": 621}, "2026-11-07": {"updated": "2026-11-07T17:59:33.761Z", "visits": 1425408, "fav": 8513, "up": 5474, "down": 812}, "2026-11-08": {"updated": "2026-11-08T17:23:04.558Z", "visits": 1933924, "fav": 10697, "up": 7009, "down": 992}, "2026-11-09": {"updated": "2026-11-09T18:00:41.382Z", "visits": 2352695, "fav": 12631, "up": 8458, "down": 1132}, "2026-11-10": {"updated": "2026-11-10T17:59:27.373Z", "visits": 2947